<title>USA: Omaha hogs up $1.50-2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up $1.50-2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.50 to $2.00 higher. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    56.50-57.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-280 lbs    55.50-56.00</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00-4.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    350-450 lbs    45.50-46.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
